  "day": 9,
  "theme": "Reported speech (backshift)",
  "pillar": "tense",
  "star": true,
  "rule_en": "In reported speech, shift the tense back one step: present → past, will → would, can → could, may → might, and present perfect/past → past perfect. Shift pronouns and time words too. Use 'tell someone' but 'say (to someone)'.",
  "rule_bn": "Reported speech-এ tense এক ধাপ পিছিয়ে যায়: present → past, will → would, can → could; pronoun ও সময়সূচক শব্দও বদলায়; 'tell' এর পরে object লাগে, 'say' এর পরে লাগে না।",
